  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0\n- #49: Added support for record primary constructors\n\nv2.1.0\n- #47: Support read-only application intent per contract\n\nv2.0.0\n- #52: Removed non-async methods\n\nv1.7.4\n- Updated Microsoft.Data.SqlClient to v6.1.1 to resolve security vulnerability\n- Improved documentation\n\nv1.7.3.1\n- Update of dependencies\n- Dropped out-of-support frameworks\n\nv1.7.3\n- #45: Fix regression of bug\n\nv1.7.2.1\n- ResultsetAttribute does not require selector to be specified\n- Updated all dependencies\n\nv1.7.2\n- #45: Fix transaction commands not being attached\n\nv1.7.1\n- #43: Fix enum parsing not supporting non-int values\n\nv1.7.0\n- #38: Lazy resolution of results\n- #38: Pre-resolution filtering of entity resultsets",
